WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.691 --> 00:00:15.712
Tommy was really worried about Dr.

2
00:00:15.752 --> 00:00:18.813
Dolittle. "Have you ever fought a bull before?"

3
00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:19.733
he asked.

4
00:00:20.613 --> 00:00:23.314
"Of course not, Tommy," the doctor replied.

5
00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:25.835
"I would never fight an animal."

6
00:00:26.955 --> 00:00:28.816
Now Tommy was truly afraid.

7
00:00:29.948 --> 00:00:33.429
The black bulls were big, strong, and very angry.

8
00:00:34.389 --> 00:00:37.270
They kicked out their hind legs and snorted loudly.

9
00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:40.671
"Stay here," Dr.

10
00:00:40.711 --> 00:00:42.191
Dolittle instructed Tommy.

11
00:00:42.931 --> 00:00:45.512
Then he opened the bull pen and went inside.

12
00:00:46.372 --> 00:00:48.453
Tommy covered his eyes with his hands.

13
00:00:48.473 --> 00:00:52.454
"Please be careful," he cried to the doctor.

14
00:00:53.754 --> 00:00:55.615
The bulls did not like humans.

15
00:00:56.395 --> 00:00:59.556
They made a circle around the doctor and glared at him.

16
00:01:01.212 --> 00:01:02.533
"What does this fool want?"

17
00:01:02.853 --> 00:01:03.573
snorted one.

18
00:01:03.593 --> 00:01:08.895
"I'm going to kick him out," said another, lowering his sharp horns.

19
00:01:08.915 --> 00:01:11.456
"That's not very nice!"

20
00:01:11.936 --> 00:01:13.157
the doctor said to them.

21
00:01:14.838 --> 00:01:17.119
The bulls blinked their eyes in surprise.

22
00:01:17.999 --> 00:01:19.440
"You can speak our language?"

23
00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:20.340
one said.

24
00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:22.701
"Of course!

25
00:01:23.261 --> 00:01:26.062
Now, I have to explain quickly," the doctor said.

26
00:01:26.082 --> 00:01:27.863
"Are you Dr.

27
00:01:30.444 --> 00:01:32.706
Dolittle?" another said in a trembling voice.

28
00:01:32.726 --> 00:01:36.488
"Yes, yes, I am," the doctor said.

29
00:01:36.508 --> 00:01:40.411
"We've heard so many wonderful things about you!"

30
00:01:40.851 --> 00:01:42.052
they cried out happily.

31
00:01:42.072 --> 00:01:46.735
"Thank you," the doctor said.

32
00:01:46.755 --> 00:01:48.636
"But please listen to me!

33
00:01:49.097 --> 00:01:50.337
We don't have much time."

34
00:01:51.058 --> 00:01:53.219
The bulls all started talking at once.

35
00:01:55.681 --> 00:01:58.683
They wanted to know how the doctor had learned their language.

36
00:01:59.544 --> 00:02:01.557
"Stop!" the largest bull said.

37
00:02:01.577 --> 00:02:04.278
"Let the doctor speak!"

38
00:02:04.298 --> 00:02:04.758
So Dr.

39
00:02:04.798 --> 00:02:06.559
Dolittle told them his plan.

40
00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:11.761
Meanwhile, Polynesia had an idea of her own.

41
00:02:12.742 --> 00:02:15.123
She and Charles went back to Don Enrique.

42
00:02:15.143 --> 00:02:17.964
"What do you want now?"

43
00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:19.505
he shouted rudely.

44
00:02:20.585 --> 00:02:22.966
Polynesia whispered in Charles' ear.

45
00:02:22.986 --> 00:02:26.548
"We'd like to place a small bet," he said.

46
00:02:28.764 --> 00:02:30.325
Don Enrique liked bets.

47
00:02:30.966 --> 00:02:32.827
That's how he had become so rich.

48
00:02:33.948 --> 00:02:36.450
"How much do you want to bet and on whom?"

49
00:02:37.091 --> 00:02:37.591
he asked.

50
00:02:37.611 --> 00:02:41.914
"Two thousand gold coins on John Dolittle," said Charles.

51
00:02:43.235 --> 00:02:45.117
"That man couldn't fight flies!"

52
00:02:45.497 --> 00:02:46.818
roared Don Enrique.

53
00:02:46.838 --> 00:02:50.621
"He thinks he is better than the Great Pepito!"

54
00:02:51.902 --> 00:02:54.164
"I have changed my mind," said Charles.

55
00:02:56.260 --> 00:03:00.181
"I knew you would," laughed Don Enrique.

56
00:03:00.201 --> 00:03:05.183
"I want to raise my bet to three thousand on Dolittle," Charles said.

57
00:03:06.163 --> 00:03:10.064
Don Enrique slapped his knee.

58
00:03:10.464 --> 00:03:13.265
"You are going to make me even richer," he said.

59
00:03:14.465 --> 00:03:15.866
He and Charles shook hands.

60
00:03:16.566 --> 00:03:17.606
The bet was made.

61
00:03:20.547 --> 00:03:24.488
Inside the arena, the crowds shouted loudly for the fight to begin.

62
00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:29.861
The mayor stood up and shouted, "Ladies and Gentlemen!

63
00:03:30.822 --> 00:03:34.803
May I present the greatest fighter of all—Pepito!"

64
00:03:36.283 --> 00:03:39.604
Tommy watched Pepito come out, holding a red cloak.

65
00:03:40.444 --> 00:03:42.645
A large bull was let out of the pen.

66
00:03:45.906 --> 00:03:48.967
The bull turned around and ran toward Pepito.

67
00:03:49.767 --> 00:03:52.328
Pepito swung his cloak and jumped away.

68
00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:56.242
The people screamed in delight and called out his name.

69
00:03:57.023 --> 00:03:58.944
After a little while, it was Dr.

70
00:03:58.984 --> 00:03:59.945
Dolittle's turn.

71
00:03:59.965 --> 00:04:04.088
"And now, John Dolittle," the mayor said quickly.

72
00:04:04.768 --> 00:04:06.410
People booed and hissed.

73
00:04:09.072 --> 00:04:11.333
The doctor walked to the middle of the arena.

74
00:04:11.954 --> 00:04:14.616
An even bigger, angrier bull was let out.

75
00:04:15.356 --> 00:04:17.818
He threw his head back and snorted loudly.

76
00:04:18.599 --> 00:04:20.260
Some women screamed in fear.

77
00:04:21.524 --> 00:04:25.506
Dr. Dolittle held up his hands, but the bull began to charge.

78
00:04:28.507 --> 00:04:31.989
When the bull got close, the doctor clapped his hands once.

79
00:04:32.769 --> 00:04:35.711
The huge animal stopped and dropped to his knees.

80
00:04:36.531 --> 00:04:38.732
Then the doctor climbed onto its back.

81
00:04:39.493 --> 00:04:41.093
The audience held its breath.

82
00:04:42.014 --> 00:04:46.336
Suddenly the doctor grabbed the bull's horns and did a handstand.

83
00:04:48.892 --> 00:04:51.914
Dr. Dolittle jumped off and the bull stood up again.

84
00:04:51.934 --> 00:04:53.555
"How was that?"

85
00:04:54.035 --> 00:04:54.876
whispered the bull.

86
00:04:54.896 --> 00:04:57.997
"You were brilliant," answered the doctor.

87
00:04:58.017 --> 00:04:59.878
"Now, one last thing."

88
00:05:00.659 --> 00:05:05.001
The doctor put out his hand and twirled it in a circle, faster and faster.

89
00:05:06.542 --> 00:05:09.504
The bull stood on its hind legs and danced around.

90
00:05:09.524 --> 00:05:13.466
Then it fell to the ground with a loud thump.

91
00:05:15.127 --> 00:05:16.548
The people went crazy.

92
00:05:17.468 --> 00:05:19.569
"The Great Dolittle!"

93
00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:22.531
they screamed.

94
00:05:22.611 --> 00:05:24.352
Dr. Dolittle looked at the mayor.

95
00:05:26.253 --> 00:05:28.634
The mayor was wiping tears from his eyes.

96
00:05:28.654 --> 00:05:32.176
"Ladies and Gentlemen," he cried.

97
00:05:32.196 --> 00:05:34.437
"I have sad news.

98
00:05:35.658 --> 00:05:37.559
This was our last bullfight."

99
00:05:38.479 --> 00:05:40.240
The crowds shouted angrily.

100
00:05:41.121 --> 00:05:44.223
The bull opened one eye and smiled at the doctor.

101
00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:46.524
"Thank you," he said.
